    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Mac Collins: Nottingham-based British furniture designer and artist (b. 1995), British-Jamaican heritage; work explores Afrofuturism and the African diaspora. Emerging-to-established and rising fast: BA 3D Design Northumbria 2018; breakout Iklwa chair (mass-produced by Benchmark); won the Design Museums inaugural Ralph Saltzman Prize (2022) and the London Design Medal Emerging Designer Medal. Work Status Freelance: independent designer/artist practice (info@maccollins.com), one-person studio. Capabilities were empty; set Industrial design (furniture/objects) + Art practice (exhibits, narrative pieces). Jonathans Worked Together Repeatedly and Rating 5 are his and kept; existing Open Questions (Familiarity, story) left for him to answer.",
